WEBVTT

00:07:58.265 --> 00:08:01.018
Which is that 50, 100 years ago,

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:04.396
teenagers were physically
roaming in the world a lot.

00:08:04.396 --> 00:08:06.065
They were on their bikes.

00:08:06.106 --> 00:08:07.900
They were walking around the streets,

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:09.485
they were congregating in fields,

00:08:09.485 --> 00:08:12.321
they could explore the world,
test boundaries,

00:08:12.363 --> 00:08:16.408
essentially, have adventures
without parents watching.

00:08:17.243 --> 00:08:20.621
Today, in many American
contexts they can't.

00:08:21.205 --> 00:08:22.581
Nevermind lockdown,

00:08:22.623 --> 00:08:25.668
even before that,
because of stranger danger,

00:08:25.709 --> 00:08:27.753
because of overscheduling,

00:08:27.795 --> 00:08:31.507
the only place they could roam
without parents watching